---
// Newsletter Section: Transparent Coming-Soon Component (Non-deceptive)
---

<section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-[#E3E8EF]" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading">
  <div class="container-main">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-[#F7F9FC] p-8 sm:p-12 text-center shadow-xs">

      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#3478F6] uppercase">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
        <span>Future Dispatches</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Heading -->
      <h2 id="newsletter-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#14233B]">
        Stay Curious. Never Stop Learning.
      </h2>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#202938]">
        We are preparing a weekly curated editorial digest bringing the most important technology breakthroughs, scientific discoveries, and practical tutorials directly to your inbox.
      </p>

      <!-- Transparent Notice -->
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white p-5 text-left">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#EEF1F5] text-[#3478F6]">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <polyline points="3 7 12 13 21 7"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#14233B]">
              Newsletter Under Development
            </p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#697586]">
              Subscription enrollment will be activated once our privacy-compliant mailing relay is live. We strictly do not collect email addresses until our delivery backend is active and verified.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Link to RSS -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-[#697586]">
        <span>Prefer immediate RSS updates?</span>
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="font-bold text-[#3478F6] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Subscribe via RSS 2.0</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
